OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured in crash on
OL,4,Abusy road
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have closed a section of the A17
OL,7,Fin both directions near Coddington
OL,8,Fafter a crash involving a car and a
OL,9,Florry.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Beckingham
OL,12,FRoad, near the junction with Stapleford
OL,13,FLane, at about 10:45 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police said a man had
OL,16,Fbeen taken to hospital with serious
OL,17,Finjuries, with the road "expected to be
OL,18,Fclosed for some time while
OL,19,Finvestigations take place".
OL,21,FMotorists are advised to find
OL,22,Falternative routes.
